  entries:
  - title: The Archivist
    text: Planar Walk successful.
    time: 3
  - title: The Archivist
    text: "Fae Crossing showed no aberrance before decay.<br>Planar Fragment Gamma-1154
      appears\u2026 stable."
    time: 4
  - title: The Archivist
    text: "\u201CTiamat\u2019s Forest.\u201D<br>The mission is to collect and analyze
      data on the landforms and lifeforms of this plane."
    time: 4
  - title: The Archivist
    text: "Though, it appears that the forest is more <i>alive</i> than predicted.<br>It
      is as if the earth itself is breathing\u2026"
    time: 5
